      <article class="legal-content">
<h2>Product summary</h2><p>ClassicFin Hub is a multi-tenant finance SaaS platform. Each tenant receives its own database, login portal, tenant profile, landing page, users, roles, permissions, branches, customers, accounts, transactions, receipts, reports, analytics, notification templates, billing, and audit logs.</p>
<h2>Who is it for?</h2><p>ClassicFin Hub is for finance businesses that want one controlled workspace for money transfer, mobile money, banking, forex, receipts, branch operations, reporting, analytics, billing, and secure audits.</p>
<h2>Core operating modules</h2><ul><li>Money Transfer: record instructions, independently review manual collection, reveal a one-time payout PIN and separately review payout.</li><li>Mobile Money: cash-in, cash-out, network float, commissions, receipts, reports, and analytics.</li><li>Banking: customers, accounts, deposits, withdrawals, account transfers, ledger entries, and statements.</li><li>Forex: approved-rate snapshots, reviewed manual buy/sell movements, currency stock and settlement books.</li></ul>
<h2>Marketing promise</h2><p>The platform helps operators launch faster, keep financial data separated, reduce manual reporting, control staff permissions, monitor daily cash, sell through a branded tenant landing page, and grow from a starter trial to advanced enterprise modules.</p><h2>Architecture focus</h2><p>The platform uses separate logical tenant databases, fixed staff permissions, versioned module plans and financial audit records. Operational readiness depends on the configured host, backups, delivery services and business controls. <a href="/product-guide">Read the current product guide</a>.</p>
      </article>
